          "detail": "Run npm test between each batch: (1) vcs tests move into test/unit/vcs/; (2) settings tests (ruleset/labels/repo-settings/code-scanning diff/formatter/processor) move into test/unit/settings/<kind>/; (3) shared-utility tests move into test/unit/shared/; (4) verify no remaining flat-root tests for modules that already have a subdirectory.",
