          "detail": "Add never-exhaustive default to 4 switch statements that lack one. (1) src/vcs/pr-creator.ts line 81: switch on f.action (type FileActionKind = 'create'|'update'|'skip'|'delete') \u2014 the filter on line 77 excludes 'skip' but the switch has a catch-all default: replace default with explicit 'skip' case (unreachable after filter) plus a never-exhaustive default. (2) src/cli/unified-summary.ts line 152: switch on lcAction.action (type LifecycleActionKind = 'existed'|'created'|'forked'|'migrated') \u2014 'existed' is already filtered on line 150, but the switch only handles 3 cases with no default: add 'default: { const _exhaustive: never = lcAction.action; throw new Error(Unexpected action: dollar{_exhaustive}); }'. (3) src/vcs/gitlab-pr-strategy.ts line 82: switch on strategy with catch-all default \u2014 add explicit 'merge' case returning empty string and a never-exhaustive default. (4) src/vcs/github-pr-strategy.ts line 223: same pattern as gitlab, switch on strategy with catch-all default \u2014 add explicit 'merge' case returning '--merge' and a never-exhaustive default. The labels/processor.ts and rulesets/processor.ts switches already handle all 4 SettingsAction cases including 'unchanged', so they are NOT targets.",
          "effort": "small",
          "issue_refs": [
            "review::.::holistic::logic_clarity::inconsistent_switch_exhaustiveness",
            "review::.::holistic::logic_clarity::pr_creator_catch_all_default"
          ],
          "done": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Type-check and verify all switches compile",
          "detail": "Run 'npm run test:typecheck' to confirm all 4 modified switch statements compile with never-exhaustive defaults. Run 'npm test' to verify no behavioral regressions. Check src/vcs/pr-creator.ts, src/cli/unified-summary.ts, src/vcs/gitlab-pr-strategy.ts, src/vcs/github-pr-strategy.ts.",
          "effort": "trivial",
          "issue_refs": [
            "review::.::holistic::logic_clarity::inconsistent_switch_exhaustiveness",
            "review::.::holistic::logic_clarity::pr_creator_catch_all_default"
          ],
          "done": true
        }
      ],
      "depends_on_clusters": [
        "error-cause-chaining"
      ]
