          "confirmed_text": "I have thoroughly reviewed all 13 open review issues across abstraction_fitness, api_surface_coherence, convention_outlier, cross_module_architecture, dependency_health, error_consistency, logic_clarity, low_level_elegance, mid_level_elegance, and type_safety dimensions. Each issue was verified by reading actual source files with specific line citations. 2 false positives identified (already-fixed code), 8 genuine actionable issues confirmed, 3 not-worth-it verdicts with code evidence."
