l pure functions preferable to class methods for stateless logic\n- lifecycle_create_inline_orchestration: already well-extracted at 67 lines, remaining inline is 13 lines\n\nStrategy item (1):\n- subjective-review-score-volatility: strategy observation, not actionable code defect\n\n## Quality Gate Verification\n\n- All 13 reflect-identified issues accounted for: 8 clustered, 5 skipped\n- 1 additional strategy item skipped (not in reflect scope)\n- Step count (6) < issue count (8): consolidation achieved\n- No cluster spans 5+ unrelated directories\n- No overlapping files between clusters, so no --depends-on needed\n- All cluster descriptions describe work, not problems\n- All skips have specific per-issue reasoning\n\n## Backlog Decisions (from reflect)\n\n- unclustered/exports-dead-code: deferred (40% false positive rate needs individual verification)\n- unclustered/remaining-backlog: deferred (197 items need individual assessment next cycle)\nNo CLI action needed for deferred backlog items.",
