e\n- Pure ISP narrowing: replace RepoConfig with PRMergeOptions in CreateAndMergeInput\n- Files: src/sync/types.ts, src/sync/pr-merge-handler.ts, src/sync/sync-workflow.ts\n\n### 6. normalizer-density-extraction (1 step, medium)\n- Read normalizer.ts lines 640-764, identified 4-phase loop body (lines 697-747) for extraction\n- Function receives 9 parameters, returns RepoConfig \u2014 follows existing helper pattern\n- File: src/config/normalizer.ts\n\n## Validation\n- All steps have 80+ char detail with file paths verified on disk\n- All steps have issue_refs linking to their review issues\n- All steps have individual effort tags\n- No skipped/wontfixed issues referenced in step refs",
