        },
        {
          "type": "score-neutral-churn",
          "description": "Abstraction fit has 83 resolved issues and 6 reopens but score only moved from 88.5 to 89.5 - a 1-point gain for massive effort. The reviewer keeps re-flagging SOLID patterns.",
